      ],
      "jp": "これまで発表されたオリオールズの特別チケットパッケージで一番好きなのは、6月15日の「鳥の巣箱」。本物の自然にいる本物の鳥のための、文字どおりの巣箱がもらえる。詳細は近日中に続報"
    },
    {
      "handle": "maccerullo.bsky.social",
      "author": "Mac Cerullo",
      "team": "レッドソックス",
      "outlet": "Boston Herald",
      "text": "The Baseball Hall of Fame has announced its 2027 ballot. Newcomers are Buster Posey, Jake Arrieta, Jon Lester, Andrew Miller and Pablo Sandoval. Lester, Miller and Sandoval all played for the Red Sox, and Lester will likely have a strong chance of earning induction eventually.",
      "likes": 9,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-16T17:15:56.625Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:3e3m65k5o27wcievtfdmmnyi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2gzr7bh5c26",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "KF Panda just officially retired this month! Albeit years after his last MLB appearance, I think he was hoping against hope he'd come back. Had a grand slam in Miami in his last pro game with Magallanes...",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "mobypinball.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Buster Posey, starting shortstop for the championship 2006 Yarmouth-Dennis Red Sox!",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "mobypinball.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "野球殿堂が2027年の候補者名簿を発表。新たに加わったのはバスター・ポージー、ジェイク・アリエッタ、ジョン・レスター、アンドルー・ミラー、パブロ・サンドバル。レスター、ミラー、サンドバルはいずれもレッドソックスでプレーし、レスターは最終的に殿堂入りする可能性が高そうだ。"
    },
    {
