        {
          "text": "Any indication if their SP interest is just to bring in one dude? For example, if they signed a guy like Boyd are they likely done adding to the rotation?",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "pfholden.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Targeting grounball starters with an IF defense that is average at best up the middle and focusing on corner OFs when the in-house options for CF are a converted corner guy with big contact concerns and a minor-leaguer who can’t hit in the high minors. Seems counterproductive.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "cwkash.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "オリオールズの市場について聞こえてくる話："
