      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "The Twins announced single-game tickets for the 2027 season* will go on sale beginning at 10 a.m. Friday.",
      "likes": 9,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-16T17:04:07.201Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2gz42puz22g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ツインズは、2027年シーズンの単独試合チケットを金曜午前10時から発売すると発表した。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "I hope they give Bond a partner. Maybe Willem Dafoe. And the move is about the dangers of killing the wrong person (or wrong thing) and the fallout of your actions, especially in isolation. Maybe we call that villain the Seabird. But to drive it home, we set it at a lighthouse off the Maine coast.",
      "likes": 7,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-16T16:02:55.495Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2gvon3wvk2b",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ボンドにはパートナーをつけてほしい。ウィレム・デフォーなんてどうだろう。そして物語は、間違った相手(あるいは間違ったもの)を殺してしまう危うさと、とくに孤立した状況での行動の代償を描く。その悪役をSeabirdと呼ぼう。そして印象づけるため、舞台はメイン州沖の灯台にする。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "I joined @randball.bsky.social on the Strib’s Daily Delivery podcast from Las Vegas last week to talk all things Twins offseason. Listen here: www.startribune.com/daily-delive...",
